+## Unexecuted draft correction
+
+The integrator rejected the first draft's additional raw-PID fallback probe
+before execution. It gave Popen a retained original handle but assigned its
+numeric PID to a foreign process. Windows prevents that reuse while the
+original process handle remains open. A failed GetProcessTimes observation
+does not itself close the handle, so this fixture did not demonstrate a
+product defect. The probe was removed, not relabeled as passed. The valid
+original-handle positive control remains.
+
+The original test and brief are retained beside this file with the suffix
+`draft01-unexecuted`. No draft has been executed. A missing recorded parent
+identity without a retained original handle is a separate boundary; this
+correction makes no finding about that case.
